      "id": "chunks",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "chunks",
      "label": "CHUNKS · 5 MIN",
      "heading": "Five chunks to use today",
      "instruction": "Learn the whole phrase. Change the details to fit your work. Mở từng thẻ khi cần; sau đó nhìn đi chỗ khác và nói lại.",
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "1/5 · Luyện hôm nay",
          "phrase": "The main reason is…",
          "meaning": "Lý do chính là…",
          "details": [
            "Give the strongest reason for your opinion.",
            "The main reason is + noun / that + clause",
            "The main reason is the cost.",
            "The main reason is that shorter meetings save time."
          ],
          "saveKey": "chunk-v1-used-1"
        },
        {
          "label": "2/5 · Luyện hôm nay",
          "phrase": "This is because…",
          "meaning": "Đó là vì…",
          "details": [
            "Explain why your previous statement is true.",
            "This is because + clause",
            "This is because the app is simple.",
            "This is because everyone can see the same task list."
          ],
          "saveKey": "chunk-v1-used-2"
        },
        {
          "label": "3/5 · Luyện hôm nay",
          "phrase": "For example…",
          "meaning": "Ví dụ…",
          "details": [
            "Support your point with a concrete example.",
            "For example, + clause",
            "For example, we can meet online.",
            "For example, our daily meeting now takes fifteen minutes."
          ],
          "saveKey": "chunk-v1-used-3"
        },
        {
          "label": "4/5 · Luyện hôm nay",
          "phrase": "A good example is…",
          "meaning": "Một ví dụ điển hình là…",
          "details": [
            "Name a specific example that supports your view.",
            "A good example is + noun",
            "A good example is our team.",
            "A good example is our short Monday meeting."
          ],
          "saveKey": "chunk-v1-used-4"
        },
        {
          "label": "5/5 · Luyện hôm nay",
          "phrase": "That's why…",
          "meaning": "Đó là lý do…",
          "details": [
            "Connect a reason to its result.",
            "That's why + clause",
            "That's why I agree.",
            "That's why I prefer a short daily meeting."
          ],
          "saveKey": "chunk-v1-used-5"
        }
      ]
